  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "奈米能源材料合成應用實驗",
    "sub_ename": "EXPERIMENTS ON SYNTHESES AND APPLICATIONS OF ENERGY NANO-MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "本實驗課程之目的在使學生瞭解奈米氧化物之製程、其能源應用特性及特性檢測技術，實驗分為兩大主題，第一部份為奈米氧化物電化學超級電容器實驗，第二部分為固態氧化物燃料電池原理實驗。課程內容包括奈米晶氧化物噴霧熱解製程實驗、電泳沈積實驗，由製程進行能源應用之電化學電容器與燃料電池電解質特性量測與分析，使學生更加瞭解材料製程與特性之關連性。此課程為實驗操作的應用學科，課程實施將側重於實驗前後的報告、測驗與課程中的表現為主。",
    "describe_eh": "The purposes of this experiment course is to increase the understanding of nano-oxide processing and its characteristics on energy applications. This course can be divided into two main experiments: electrochemical supercapacitor of nano-oxides and nano-oxide characteristics of solid oxide fuel cell. The characterization techniques and preparation of nano-oxides via spray pyrolysis are also carried out to further understand the relationships between processing and their relative properties. This course is an applied subject of experimental operation. The implementation of the course will focus on the report before and after the experiment, the test and the performance in the course.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能用自己的詞彙定義何謂超級電容器：能夠描述超級電容器的歷史、發電原理、種類。",
      "describe_en": "Define Supercapacitor with their own words: Be able to describe the  history of Supercapacitor、generating electric power of kinds of Supercapacitor."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能瞭解並說明超級電容器在社會及經濟層面的重要性及影響。",
      "describe_en": "Understand and be able to explain the importance and effects of Supercapacitor to society and economy."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能使用相關設備，實驗超級電容器實驗測試。",
      "describe_en": "Be able to use related equipment to finish an experiment about Supercapacitor."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能透過小組展現團隊合作能力。",
      "describe_en": " Demonstrate esprit de corps (team spirit) through teamwork."
    }
  ],
